
1. build 1600 FPGA GPU test image:

make T=hwtest CHIP=best1600 FPGA=1 NO_PMU=1 TC="GPU_TEST"  all lst -j8 SIMU=0 NO_CLOCK_INIT=1 V=1 ROM_SIZE=0x00030000 TRACE_BAUD_RATE=460800 GRADRV_TMST=1 GRADRV_DEBUG=1 BAREMETAL=1  GPU_TESTCASE=1 ALLOW_WARNING=1 NOSTD=0

2. build 1600 FPGA GPU test image with serial fs support:

make T=hwtest CHIP=best1600 FPGA=1 NO_PMU=1 TC="GPU_TEST " all lst -j8 SIMU=0 NO_CLOCK_INIT=1 V=1 ROM_SIZE=0x00030000 TRACE_BAUD_RATE=460800 GRADRV_TMST=1 GRADRV_DEBUG=1 BAREMETAL=1  GPU_TESTCASE=1 ALLOW_WARNING=1 NOSTD=0 TEST_WITH_FS=1

NOTE: start sfs service(sfss) at linux pc side, gpu test program can send fb image raw data to pc

3. build 1600 FPGA GPU test image with lcd(rgb565) displayer :

make T=hwtest CHIP=best1600 FPGA=1 NO_PMU=1 TC="GPU_TEST" all lst -j8 SIMU=0 NO_CLOCK_INIT=1 V=1 ROM_SIZE=0x00030000 TRACE_BAUD_RATE=460800 GRADRV_TMST=1 GRADRV_DEBUG=1 BAREMETAL=1 FBTEST_DRV=1 GPU_TESTCASE=1 ALLOW_WARNING=1 NOSTD=0 QSPI_DISPLAY_TEST=1 TEST_WITH_LCD=1 QSPI_DMA_LINKLIST=1 QSPI_SBO=1

NOTE: lcd panel is gc9c01

4. build 1600 FPGA GPU dma2d and lcdc test image with uart0 output:

make T=hwtest CHIP=best1600 FPGA=1 NO_PMU=1 TC="GPU_TEST GRAPHIC_TEST" all lst -j8 SIMU=0 NO_CLOCK_INIT=1 V=1 ROM_SIZE=0x00030000 TRACE_BAUD_RATE=460800 GRADRV_TMST=1 GRADRV_DEBUG=1 BAREMETAL=1 FBTEST_DRV=1 GPU_TESTCASE=1 ALLOW_WARNING=1 NOSTD=0
